<title>USA: TABLE - McDonalds Corp sells $150 mln notes.</title>
<headline>TABLE - McDonalds Corp sells $150 mln notes.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following debt issue from McDonalds Corp was priced Wednesday according to lead manager Salomon Brothers</p>
<p>McDonalds Corp is the world's largest fast food restaurant chain.</p>
<p>BORROWER MCDONALDS CORP</p>
<p>AMT $150 MLN	 COUPON 6.50 PCT   MATURITY 8/1/2007</p>
<p>TYPE NOTES	   ISS PRICE 99.927  FIRST PAY DATE 2/1/1998</p>
<p>LAST MOODY'S AA2   YIELD  6.510 PCT  PAY FREQ  SEMI-ANNUAL</p>
<p>LAST S&amp;P AA	  SPREAD +37.5 BPS  CALLABLE  NO</p>
<p>((U.S. Corporate Bond Unit, 212-859-1678))</p>
</text>
